        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būlyehu wene būkanji wa Būsangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baana bane, ī yenīyī nalīng'wandīkīla gīkī mutizīīta shibi; alīyo ūlū munhū wīta shibi tūlī na Nombeji ū kūlī Sīswe, ng'wene Kilisito Yesu ū ntūngīlīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wei h'ūyo alī shitambo kūlwa shibi shise, hama nīyo ītī kūlwa shibi shise dūhū, alīyo sha bose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū tūshidima ī shilagīlo shakwe hū tūkūmana gīkī tūndeebile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūhaya gīkī andeebile alīyo ūbiza atashidimile ī shilagīlo shakwe, ū ng'wenūyo nomolomo; hama nū būtūngīlīja būtīmo ū mulī we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūyo agūdimile ū mhayo gokwe, ū ng'wenūyo ntūngīlīja, nū būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu būshikanyiwe ū mulī we. Ū mu gīko hū tūkūmana gīkī tūlī mulī we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū wa kūhaya gīkī alī mulī wei, shiigelile nang'hwe ashimīzīle mu nhūngwa gītī jakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo shipya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Batogwa, natūng'wandīkīlaga shilagīlo shipya, alīyo shaho na kale; īsho mulī nasho kūfuma kale na kale. Ī shilagīlo sha kale shenīsho hū gwene ū mhayo ūyo ng'wamalile kūgwigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo hangī nalīng'wandīkīla shilagīlo shipya, ū mhayo gwa ng'hana ūyo gūlī mulī wei, hamò nū mu bing'we; nguno ī giiti shilībīta, ī lisana lya ng'hana līkwaakaga ī haha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo akwihayaga gīkī alī ng'wisana alīyo ūbiza ankolilwe ndūgūye, ū ng'wenūyo ataalī mu giiti nī haha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo antogilwe ndūgūye alī ng'wisana, nīyo ū mulī wei shitīmo sha kwipamya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūyo ankolilwe ndūgūye alī mu giiti, nīyo akūshimīzīlaga mu giiti; atamanile nūūlū hado ūko ajile, nguno ī giiti shimbokugije a miso gakwe!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kwītogwa ī sī, pyī nī sha mu sī; ūlū munhū ūtogwa sī, ū būtogwa bo ng'wa Sīswe būkūbiza būtīmo ū mulī we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno pyī ī sha mu sī, gītī kwikūmva kwa mīlī, kwikūmva kwa miso, na kūdoosela būpanga; shitafumaga kūlī Sīswe, ī shoi shilī sha mu sī! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ī sī īlībīta, hamò nū kwikūmva kwamo; lelo ū wa kwīta īyo yīnyegije Mulungu, ū ng'wene alī wa kūshinga welelo bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Būhūgūlwa kū lwa ng'wilwisha wa ng'wa Kilisito",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we baana, ī likanza īlī līlī lya kū būkalīkījo; hūna lūūlū gīt'ūmo ng'wamala kwigwa gīkī akwiza Ng'wilwisha wa ng'wa Kilisito, nī haha balīho bingī a bilwisha ba ng'wa Kilisito. H'ī nguno yene tūlīmana gīkī tūlī ng'wikanza lya kū būkalīkījo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakūfumaga mu bise, alīyo ī gete a boi batī bichiswi, nguno ūlū ni baalī bichiswi ni bikala hamò nise, gwike ī haha īlīmanīka hape gīkī batī bichiswi pye a bose! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we ng'witīīlilwe Moyo Ng'wela kūfuma kūlī we ūyo alī ng'wela, nose hū kūhaya ng'wīmanile pyī ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natūng'wandīkīlaga īkī gīkī mutīmanile ī ng'hana, alīyo īkī ng'wīmanile; na hangī īkī būtīmo būlomolomo bose bose ū mu ng'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī gīsī ū nomolomo alī nani, ūlū atī ūyo alemile kūzunya gīkī ū Yesu hū ng'wene ū Kilisito? Ū ng'wenūyo hū ng'wene ū Ng'wilwisha wa ng'wa Kilisito, h'ūyo anemile ū Sīswe pyī nū Ng'wana! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būlī ng'wene ūyo anemile ū Ng'wana, nū Sīswe atī nang'hwe; ū wa kūkaanīla gīkī alī nang'hwe ū Ng'wana, ū ng'wenūyo alī nang'hwe nū Sīswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we ikalagi ū mu mhayo ūyo mugwigwile kūfuma ha wandījo. Ū mhayo ūyo mugwigwile kūfuma ha wandījo gwenūyo ūlū gwikala ū mu bing'we, ning'we mukwikala mo ū mulī Ng'wana nū mulī Sīswe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mhayo ūyo atwisagīgije gwene ūyū, būpanga bo welelo bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'wandīkīlaga ī mihayo yenīyī kūlwa nguno ya banhū abo bakūmuhūbyaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a bing'we ū Moyo Ng'wela ūyo ng'witīīlilwe kūfuma kūlī Kilisito alī hamò ning'we, nose mutī na nguno ya kūlangwa na munhū ose ose. Hūna lūūlū ikalagi mo dūhū ū mulī we, gīt'ūmo Moyo Ng'wela akūmulangaga mu yose. Ū mhayo gwenūyū gūlī gwa ng'hana, gūtī gwa būlomolomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ī haha baana, ikalagi mulī wei. Ūlū ng'wīta gīko tūtūbiza na booba ūlū oolechiwa, tūtūgooka ū kū būtongi bokwe a h'ikanza lya kūshoka kwakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 2:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū mubize mumanile gīkī ū wei ntūngīlīja, managi nī gīkī būlī munhū ūyo akīītaga ya būtūngīlīja abyalilwe na ng'wene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.2.29"
            ]
          }
